#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:8 blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:12
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:15
#, xml-text
msgid "Running a Subversion Server"
msgstr "Executando um Servidor &quot;Subversion&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:18
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This section will describe how to set up, administer and secure a "
"<application>Subversion</application> server."
msgstr ""
"Esta seção descreverá como configurar, administrar e proteger um servidor "
"&quot;<application>Subversion</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:22
#, xml-text
msgid "Subversion Server Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do Servidor &quot;Subversion&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:24
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref linkend=\"subversion\"/> and <xref linkend=\"openssh\"/>"
msgstr "<xref linkend=\"subversion\"/> e <xref linkend=\"openssh\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:33
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting up a Subversion Server."
msgstr "Configurando um Servidor Subversion."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:36
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following instructions will install a "
"<application>Subversion</application> server, which will be set up to use "
"<application>OpenSSH</application> as the secure remote access method, with "
"<command>svnserve</command> available for anonymous access."
msgstr ""
"As seguintes instruções instalarão um servidor "
"&quot;<application>Subversion</application>&quot;, que será configurado para"
" usar &quot;<application>OpenSSH</application>&quot; como o método de acesso"
" remoto seguro, com &quot;<command>svnserve</command>&quot; disponível para "
"acesso anônimo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Configuration of the <application>Subversion</application> server consists "
"of the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"A configuração do servidor &quot;<application>Subversion</application>&quot;"
" consiste nas seguintes etapas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:49
#, xml-text
msgid "1. Set Uup Users, Groups, and Permissions"
msgstr "1. Configurar Usuários(as), Grupos e Permissões"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:52
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You'll need to be user <systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem> for "
"the initial portion of configuration. Create the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">svn</systemitem> user and group with the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Você precisará ser o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem>&quot; para a parte inicial da "
"configuração. Crie o(a) usuário(a) e grupo &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">svn</systemitem>&quot; com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:59
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 56 svn &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"SVN Owner\" -d /home/svn -m -g svn -s /bin/false -u 56 svn</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 56 svn &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Proprietário(a) do SVN\" -d /home/svn -m -g svn -s /bin/false -u 56 svn</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:63
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you plan to have multiple repositories, you should have a group dedicated"
" to each repository for ease of administration. Create the <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem> group for the test repository and "
"add the <systemitem class=\"username\">svn</systemitem> user to that group "
"with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você planeja ter vários repositórios, [então] deveria ter um grupo "
"dedicado para cada repositório para facilitar a administração. Crie o grupo "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot; para o "
"repositório de teste e adicione o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">svn</systemitem>&quot; a esse grupo com os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:71
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 57 svntest &amp;&amp;\n"
"usermod -G svntest -a svn</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 57 svntest &amp;&amp;\n"
"usermod -G svntest -a svn</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally you should set <command>umask 002</command> while working with "
"a repository so that all new files will be writable by owner and group. This"
" is made mandatory by creating a wrapper script for <command>svn</command> "
"and <command>svnserve</command>:"
msgstr ""
"Além disso, você deveria configurar &quot;<command>umask 002</command>&quot;"
" enquanto trabalha com um repositório, de forma que todos os novos arquivos "
"sejam escrevíveis pelo(a) proprietário(a) e pelo grupo. Isso é tornado "
"obrigatório criando-se um &quot;script&quot; envólucro para "
"&quot;<command>svn</command>&quot; e "
"&quot;<command>svnserve</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:81
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv /usr/bin/svn /usr/bin/svn.orig &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv /usr/bin/svnserve /usr/bin/svnserve.orig &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /usr/bin/svn &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"umask 002\n"
"/usr/bin/svn.orig \"$@\"</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /usr/bin/svnserve &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"umask 002\n"
"/usr/bin/svnserve.orig \"$@\"</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod 0755 /usr/bin/svn{,serve}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv /usr/bin/svn /usr/bin/svn.orig &amp;&amp;\n"
"mv /usr/bin/svnserve /usr/bin/svnserve.orig &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /usr/bin/svn &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"umask 002\n"
"/usr/bin/svn.orig \"$@\"</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /usr/bin/svnserve &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"umask 002\n"
"/usr/bin/svnserve.orig \"$@\"</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod 0755 /usr/bin/svn{,serve}</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you use <application>Apache</application> for working with the repository"
" over HTTP, even for anonymous access, you should wrap "
"<command>/usr/sbin/httpd</command> in a similar script."
msgstr ""
"Se usar o &quot;<application>Apache</application>&quot; para trabalhar com o"
" repositório via &quot;HTTP&quot;, mesmo para acesso anônimo, [então] você "
"deveria agrupar &quot;<command>/usr/sbin/httpd</command>&quot; em um "
"&quot;script&quot; semelhante."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "2. Create a Subversion repository."
msgstr "2. Criar um repositório Subversion."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are several ways to set up a subversion repository. It is recommended "
"to have a look at the <ulink url=\"https://svnbook.red-"
"bean.com/nightly/en/svn.reposadmin.html\">SVN Book</ulink> corresponding "
"chapter. A basic repository can be set up with the instructions below."
msgstr ""
"Existem várias maneiras de configurar um repositório &quot;Subversion&quot;."
" Recomenda-se dar uma olhada no capítulo correspondente do <ulink "
"url=\"https://svnbook.red-bean.com/nightly/en/svn.reposadmin.html\">Livro "
"SVN</ulink>. Um repositório básico pode ser configurado com as instruções "
"abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create a new <application>Subversion</application> repository with the "
"following commands (as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root </systemitem>"
" user):"
msgstr ""
"Crie um novo repositório &quot;<application>Subversion</application>&quot; "
"com os seguintes comandos (como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m 0755 -d /srv/svn &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 0755 -o svn -g svn -d /srv/svn/repositories &amp;&amp;\n"
"svnadmin create /srv/svn/repositories/svntest</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m 0755 -d /srv/svn &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m 0755 -o svn -g svn -d /srv/svn/repositories &amp;&amp;\n"
"svnadmin create /srv/svn/repositories/svntest</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now that the repository is created, it should be populated with something "
"useful. You'll need to have a predefined directory layout set up exactly as "
"you want your repository to look. For example, here is a sample BLFS layout "
"setup with a root of <filename>svntest/</filename>. You'll need to set up a "
"directory tree similar to the following:"
msgstr ""
"Agora que o repositório foi criado, ele deveria ser povoado com algo útil. "
"Você precisará ter um esquema predefinido de diretório configurado "
"exatamente como deseja que seu repositório aparente. Por exemplo, aqui está "
"um exemplo de configuração de esquema do BLFS com uma raiz de "
"&quot;<filename>svntest/</filename>&quot;. Você precisará configurar uma "
"árvore de diretórios semelhante à seguinte:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:135
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>svntest/            # The name of the repository\n"
"   trunk/           # Contains the existing source tree\n"
"      BOOK/\n"
"      bootscripts/\n"
"      edguide/\n"
"      patches/\n"
"      scripts/\n"
"   branches/        # Needed for additional branches\n"
"   tags/            # Needed for tagging release points</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>svntest/            # O nome do repositório\n"
"   trunk/           # Contém a árvore existente de fonte\n"
"      BOOK/\n"
"      bootscripts/\n"
"      edguide/\n"
"      patches/\n"
"      scripts/\n"
"   branches/        # Necessário para ramificações adicionais\n"
"   tags/            # Necessário para rotular pontos de lançamento</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Once you've created your directory layout as shown above, you are ready to "
"do the initial import:"
msgstr ""
"Depois que tiver criado teu esquema do diretório conforme mostrado acima, "
"você estará pronto(a) para fazer a importação inicial:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:150
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>svn import -m \"Initial import.\" \\\n"
"    <replaceable>&lt;/path/to/source/tree&gt;</replaceable>      \\\n"
"    file:///srv/svn/repositories/svntest</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>svn import -m \"Importação inicial.\" \\\n"
"    <replaceable>&lt;/caminho/para/árvore/fonte&gt;</replaceable>      \\\n"
"    file:///srv/svn/repositories/svntest</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now change owner and group information on the repository, and add an "
"unprivileged user to the <systemitem class=\"groupname\">svn</systemitem> "
"and <systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem> groups:"
msgstr ""
"Agora mude as informações do(a) proprietário(a) e do grupo no repositório e "
"adicione um(a) usuário(a) sem privilégios aos grupos &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svn</systemitem>&quot; e &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:161
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>chown -R svn:svntest /srv/svn/repositories/svntest    &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod -R g+w         /srv/svn/repositories/svntest    &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod g+s            /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/db &amp;&amp;\n"
"usermod -G svn,svntest -a <replaceable>&lt;username&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>chown -R svn:svntest /srv/svn/repositories/svntest    &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod -R g+w         /srv/svn/repositories/svntest    &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod g+s            /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/db &amp;&amp;\n"
"usermod -G svn,svntest -a <replaceable>&lt;nome_usuário(a)&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem> is the group assigned "
"to the svntest repository. As mentioned earlier, this eases administration "
"of multiple repositories when using <application>OpenSSH</application> for "
"authentication. Going forward, you'll need to add your unprivileged user, "
"and any additional users that you wish to have write access to the "
"repository, to the <systemitem class=\"groupname\">svn</systemitem> and "
"<systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem> groups."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot; é o grupo "
"atribuído ao repositório &quot;svntest&quot;. Conforme mencionado "
"anteriormente, isso facilita a administração de repositórios múltiplos ao "
"usar &quot;<application>OpenSSH</application>&quot; para autenticação. A "
"partir de agora, você precisará adicionar teu(ua) usuário(a) sem "
"privilégios, e quaisquer usuários(as) adicionais que desejar ter acesso de "
"escrita ao repositório, aos grupos &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svn</systemitem>&quot; e &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In addition, you'll notice that the new repository's <filename>db</filename>"
" directory is set-groupID. If the reasoning is not immediately obvious, when"
" using any external authentication method (such as <command>ssh</command>), "
"the sticky bit is set so that all new files will be owned by the user, but "
"group of <systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>. Anyone in the"
" <systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem> group can create "
"files, but still give the entire group write access to those files. This "
"avoids locking out other users from the repository."
msgstr ""
"Além disso, você notará que o diretório &quot;<filename>db</filename>&quot; "
"do novo repositório está configurado o &quot;ID&quot; de grupo. Se o "
"raciocínio não for imediatamente óbvio, [então] ao usar qualquer método "
"externo de autenticação (como &quot;<command>ssh</command>&quot;), o bit "
"&quot;sticky&quot; é configurado, de forma que todos os novos arquivos sejam"
" de propriedade do(a) usuário(a), mas do grupo de &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot;. Qualquer um(a) no grupo "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"groupname\">svntest</systemitem>&quot; consegue "
"criar arquivos, mas, ainda assim, conceder ao grupo inteiro acesso de "
"escrita a esses arquivos. Isso evita bloquear outros(as) usuários(as) fora "
"do repositório."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, return to an unprivileged user account, and take a look at the new "
"repository using <command>svnlook</command>:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, retorne para uma conta de usuário(a) sem privilégios e dê uma olhada "
"no novo repositório usando &quot;<command>svnlook</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:194
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>svnlook tree /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>svnlook tree /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You may need to log out and back in again to refresh your group memberships."
" <command>su <replaceable>&lt;username&gt;</replaceable></command> should "
"work as well."
msgstr ""
"Você possivelmente precise sair e entrar novamente para atualizar tuas "
"titularidades de membros(as) de grupo. &quot;<command>su "
"<replaceable>&lt;nome_de_usuário(a)&gt;</replaceable></command>&quot; também"
" deveria funcionar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "3. Configure the Server"
msgstr "3. Configurar o Servidor"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As mentioned previously, these instructions will configure the server to use"
" only <command>ssh</command> for write access to the repository and to "
"provide anonymous access using <command>svnserve</command>. There are "
"several other ways to provide access to the repository. These additional "
"configurations are best explained at <ulink url=\"https://svnbook.red-"
"bean.com/\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Como mencionado anteriormente, estas instruções configurarão o servidor para"
" usar somente &quot;<command>ssh</command>&quot; para acesso de escrita ao "
"repositório e para fornecer acesso anônimo usando "
"&quot;<command>svnserve</command>&quot;. Existem várias outras maneiras de "
"fornecer acesso ao repositório. Essas configurações adicionais estão melhor "
"explicadas em <ulink url=\"https://svnbook.red-bean.com/\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Access configuration needs to be done for each repository.  Create the "
"<filename>svnserve.conf</filename> file for the svntest repository using the"
" following commands:"
msgstr ""
"A configuração de acesso precisa ser feita para cada repositório. Crie o "
"arquivo &quot;<filename>svnserve.conf</filename>&quot; para o repositório "
"&quot;svntest&quot; usando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:225
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf \\\n"
"   /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf.default &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[general]\n"
"anon-access = read\n"
"auth-access = write</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf \\\n"
"   /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf.default &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /srv/svn/repositories/svntest/conf/svnserve.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[general]\n"
"anon-access = read\n"
"auth-access = write</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There is not a lot to the configuration file at all. You'll notice that only"
" the general section is required. Take a look at the "
"<filename>svnserve.conf.default</filename> file for information on using "
"<command>svnserve</command>'s built-in authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Não há muito no arquivo de configuração. Você notará que somente a seção "
"geral é exigida. Dê uma olhada no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>svnserve.conf.default</filename>&quot; para informações "
"relativas a usar o método de autenticação integrado do "
"&quot;<command>svnserve</command>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid "4. Starting the Server"
msgstr "4. Iniciar o Servidor"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the server at boot time, install the svn bootscript included in the"
" <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o servidor durante a inicialização, instale o "
"&quot;script&quot; de inicialização &quot;svn&quot; incluído no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the server at boot time, install the "
"<filename>svnserve.service</filename> unit from the <xref linkend=\"systemd-"
"units\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o servidor durante a inicialização, instale a unidade "
"&quot;<filename>svnserve.service</filename>&quot; a partir do pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"systemd-units\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "svn"
msgstr "svn"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:261
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-svn</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-svn</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid "svnserve"
msgstr "svnserve"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:267
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-svnserve</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-svnserve</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:270
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally, the instructions above require that svn server uses "
"<command>umask 002</command> so that all new files will be writable by owner"
" and group. This can be achieved by creating a systemd unit override file by"
" running the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Além disso, as instruções acima exigem que o servidor &quot;svn&quot; use "
"&quot;<command>umask 002</command>&quot;, de forma que todos os novos "
"arquivos serão escrevíveis pelo(a) proprietário(a) e pelo grupo. Isso pode "
"ser conseguido criando-se um arquivo de unidade &quot;systemd&quot; de "
"substituição executando-se o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:276
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/svnserve.service.d\n"
"echo \"UMask=0002\" > /etc/systemd/system/svnserve.service.d/99-user.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/svnserve.service.d\n"
"echo \"UMask=0002\" > /etc/systemd/system/svnserve.service.d/99-user.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/svnserver.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Options which are passed to <command>svnserve</command> daemon can be "
"changed in <filename>/etc/default/svnserve</filename>."
msgstr ""
"As opções que são passadas para o processo de segundo plano "
"&quot;<command>svnserve</command>&quot; podem ser mudadas em "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/default/svnserve</filename>&quot;."
